        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="354.6867" YPOS="2527.1872" OwnPage="3" ItemID="182499888" PTYPE="2" WIDTH="342.8821" HEIGHT="454.0628" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="0.530447196261682" LOCALSCY="0.530447196261682" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="0" RATIO="1" Pagenumber="0" PFILE="5.5 images/Cryptid Corner Vol 29.png" IRENDER="0" EMBEDDED="0" path="M0 0 L342.882 0 L342.882 454.063 L0 454.063 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L342.882 0 L342.882 454.063 L0 454.063 L0 0 Z" gXpos="354.6867" gYpos="2527.1872" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1"/>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="460.9182" YPOS="1328.4" OwnPage="1" ItemID="194135136" PTYPE="2" WIDTH="234.3943" HEIGHT="302.256" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="0.183185454545455" LOCALSCY="0.183185454545455" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="0" RATIO="1" Pagenumber="0" PFILE="5.5 images/KGB Invades Cathy.png" IRENDER="0" EMBEDDED="0" path="M0 0 L234.394 0 L234.394 302.256 L0 302.256 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L234.394 0 L234.394 302.256 L0 302.256 L0 0 Z" ImageRes="0" gXpos="460.9182" gYpos="1328.4" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1"/>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="114.5022" YPOS="1168.7612" OwnPage="1" ItemID="181866688" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="273.8103" HEIGHT="194.7388" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L273.81 0 L273.81 194.739 L0 194.739 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L273.81 0 L273.81 194.739 L0 194.739 L0 0 Z" gXpos="114.5022" gYpos="1168.7612" gWidth="268.411518861382" gHeight="214.4468" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="WP"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Vegan"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="0" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT CH="    The average lifespan of "/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" CH="marmota momax"/>
                <ITEXT CH=", the common groundhog, is 2 to 3 years. That is 2 to 3 years too long. I don’t remember what that fuckass rodent said or did back in February, but whether that little prick saw his shadow or not is really irrelevant to the fact that, twice in the last two weeks, the temperature dropped 40 degrees from one day to the next. If this had happened once, I would have forgiven him. It wasn’t bad the first time. I spent my entire day going “wow, will ya believe the weather?” to people, who appreciated my observations and wittiness. But twice? I am not a hateful person, but Punxsutawney Phil has got to go. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="     I have found that Punxsutawney, PA is just under 80 miles from Pittsburgh. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Conveniently, at the time of writing this, I am just under 8 feet away from my 0.22 rimfire rifle. Ultimately, I believe in treating all living things with respect. That is why I will skin him, and make a hat out of his pelt. Although it is a shame to kill an animal, this strategic act will send a message to all future iterations, hopefully preventing more bloodshed."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
